      <p class="card-desc">A Photoshop-style image slicing tool that runs entirely in your browser. Draw slices, grid-cut sprite sheets, use guides, and bulk export to PNG, JPEG, WebP, TGA, BMP, TIFF, or ICO — straight into a folder you pick, or as a ZIP. Built for game devs and artists.</p>
